  "safetyNotes": "Runs a local OpenAI-compatible proxy on 127.0.0.1:51122 that translates between PI-Desktop and Google's Cloud Code Assist API, so the app never talks to Google directly. Signs in with Google OAuth (PKCE, loopback redirect) and keeps tokens in ~/.pi/agent; the app's own credential is preferred and refreshed by the host. Reads and writes only inside the plugin package and ~/.pi/agent (account store, generated images). No telemetry, no third-party endpoints: all network traffic goes to Google APIs through your system proxy.",
  "changelog": "0.12.0 — first public release.\n- Native provider for Antigravity / Cloud Code Assist (Gemini 4 Argon, Gemini 3.8 Flash, Claude Opus/Sonnet 5.5, GPT-OSS 120B) with per-effort thinking levels.\n- In-chat image generation: intercepts the built-in GenerateImages tool (whose oauth-provider path is closed) and renders results inline as markdown.\n- In-chat grounded web search with citations.\n- Sidebar panel: account status, quota buckets, manual image/search, model discovery.\n- Automatic token refresh and multi-endpoint failover.",
  "i18n": {
    "en": {
      "name": "Antigravity for PI-Desktop",
      "description": "Use Google Antigravity / Cloud Code Assist models (Gemini, Claude, GPT-OSS) as a native PI-Desktop provider on your own Google account quota: chat, in-chat image generation, grounded web search, and quota monitoring.",
      "safetyNotes": "Runs a local OpenAI-compatible proxy on 127.0.0.1:51122 that translates between PI-Desktop and Google's Cloud Code Assist API, so the app never talks to Google directly. Signs in with Google OAuth (PKCE, loopback redirect) and keeps tokens in ~/.pi/agent; the app's own credential is preferred and refreshed by the host. Reads and writes only inside the plugin package and ~/.pi/agent (account store, generated images). No telemetry, no third-party endpoints: all network traffic goes to Google APIs through your system proxy."
    },
    "zh-CN": {
      "name": "Antigravity for PI-Desktop",
      "description": "把 Google Antigravity / Cloud Code Assist 模型（Gemini、Claude、GPT-OSS）接成 PI-Desktop 的原生 provider，走你自己的 Google 账号配额：对话、会话内生图、联网搜索、配额监控。",
      "safetyNotes": "在 127.0.0.1:51122 起一个本地 OpenAI 兼容代理，在 PI-Desktop 与 Google Cloud Code Assist API 之间做协议转换，App 不直连 Google。使用 Google OAuth（PKCE + 本地回环）登录，令牌存放在 ~/.pi/agent；宿主自带的凭据优先并由宿主刷新。只读写插件包内目录与 ~/.pi/agent（账号存储、生成的图片）。无遥测、无第三方端点，全部流量经系统代理发往 Google API。"
    }
  }
